            "  • shell — `git log --since=...` for commits since "
            "last session, `git status` for in-flight work, "
            "`org-llm log --reflect` for CLI/MCP patterns.\n"
            "  • org-llm_delegate — on phase landing, delegate to "
            "atoz for the wiki cascade (roadmap status, audit-log, "
            "00-index row).\n"
            "\n"
            "DEFAULTS:\n"
            "  • DAILY VIEW — return every STARTED heading (any "
            "section, not just :@active:), HOLD/WAITING blockers, "
            "top 3 from :@next:. STARTED is the source of truth "
            "for 'in flight' — user's mental model is by "
